WEBVTT

00:19.980 --> 00:22.370
Commander, we found an inn ahead.

00:22.530 --> 00:24.460
It's located on the only route
to Bailejing.

00:24.460 --> 00:26.690
We should be able to get information
about Bailejing there.

00:26.690 --> 00:29.940
Adjutant Zhang, go and scout ahead.

00:33.370 --> 00:34.370
Understood.

00:56.570 --> 00:57.740
Coming.

01:00.350 --> 01:03.270
It's so late, and there are still people
coming here to die?

01:03.270 --> 01:05.069
You guys go hide first, quickly.

01:05.209 --> 01:05.930
Coming!

01:10.350 --> 01:11.730
In the dead of night...

01:24.760 --> 01:26.410
Sirs, are you here for a stay?

01:27.070 --> 01:27.730
Sirs.

01:45.820 --> 01:46.539
Officers,

01:46.570 --> 01:47.830
do you want some rooms?

01:48.900 --> 01:50.900
How many people can this place hold?

01:51.210 --> 01:51.940
My little inn

01:52.180 --> 01:53.570
can hold over 30 people.

02:00.720 --> 02:02.280
We'll book the whole place.

02:03.300 --> 02:04.230
The whole place?

02:05.370 --> 02:06.630
There are only 4 of you.

02:06.760 --> 02:08.889
I'm afraid you won't be able to fill it.

02:17.520 --> 02:18.800
Okay, okay.

02:18.829 --> 02:20.910
I'm going to discuss it
with the guests now.

02:20.910 --> 02:22.220
Please sit and wait for a while.

02:22.220 --> 02:24.880
We'll serve you
nice food and wine immediately.

02:25.250 --> 02:26.579
Please take your seats.

02:39.180 --> 02:40.250
Just 4 soldiers.

02:40.370 --> 02:41.300
Let's kill them.

02:42.590 --> 02:44.500
They don't look like Nanqiang warlords.

02:44.500 --> 02:45.990
I think they should be scouts.

02:45.990 --> 02:47.100
If we wipe them out,

02:47.130 --> 02:48.390
no one should find out.

02:48.579 --> 02:49.590
Let's kill them

02:49.640 --> 02:50.410
after they collapse.

02:50.410 --> 02:50.860
Okay.

02:51.500 --> 02:53.220
The Chief just told us

02:53.280 --> 02:55.050
to turn over a new leaf.

02:55.530 --> 02:56.970
How does the saying go?

02:58.370 --> 02:59.500
"Only kill bad people,

02:59.500 --> 03:00.810
not good ones."

03:01.300 --> 03:01.970
Besides,

03:02.500 --> 03:04.780
these soldiers are no pushovers.

03:05.580 --> 03:07.550
But there are knockout drops in the water.

03:07.550 --> 03:08.480
Knockout drops?

03:11.810 --> 03:12.740
Adjutant Zhang,

03:13.020 --> 03:14.580
I heard you used to be

03:14.870 --> 03:16.800
a member of the Southern Archives.

03:17.470 --> 03:18.870
It seems that the two of us

03:18.900 --> 03:20.960
do have quite a bit of fate between us.

03:23.020 --> 03:24.750
I have a very excellent memory.

03:25.500 --> 03:26.300
Captain Chen,

03:27.300 --> 03:29.360
I think we haven't met before, right?

03:31.410 --> 03:32.610
How should I put it?

03:32.850 --> 03:34.540
When I was in Nanyang,

03:34.620 --> 03:36.880
I killed all the people in your Archives.

03:38.110 --> 03:39.800
And you killed all my men

03:39.840 --> 03:41.740
in our Xiaojiang camp.

03:43.400 --> 03:43.800
I'm wondering

03:43.800 --> 03:45.650
if this is also a kind

03:45.970 --> 03:47.100
of special destiny.

03:51.530 --> 03:53.530
The people of the Southern Archives

03:53.530 --> 03:55.180
acted very covertly.

03:56.030 --> 03:57.829
They were just like mice,

03:57.850 --> 03:59.079
hard to find

03:59.500 --> 04:00.500
and kill.

04:01.710 --> 04:02.580
Therefore,

04:03.220 --> 04:04.220
killing them

04:04.860 --> 04:07.060
gave me a greater sense of achievement.

04:26.160 --> 04:27.890
Why don't you tell me more about

04:31.310 --> 04:32.450
how you killed them?

04:39.500 --> 04:41.430
If you really want to hear about it,

04:48.659 --> 04:49.860
I'll tell you.

04:52.580 --> 04:53.540
I

04:53.980 --> 04:55.180
have

04:55.570 --> 04:56.930
a little hobby.

04:57.620 --> 04:58.540
I like

04:58.560 --> 05:00.360
to collect pretty human skin.

05:01.730 --> 05:04.290
I especially like the exquisite, tattooed

05:04.740 --> 05:06.060
human skin of the staff

05:06.160 --> 05:07.290
from your Archives.

05:11.620 --> 05:13.860
Every time I caught them,

05:14.190 --> 05:15.630
I used a knife

05:15.660 --> 05:17.190
to cut a cross

05:17.490 --> 05:19.490
on the top of their heads.

05:20.490 --> 05:21.370
And then,

05:21.660 --> 05:23.170
I slowly poured

05:23.330 --> 05:25.410
mercury in,

05:27.340 --> 05:28.660
so their blood

05:28.890 --> 05:30.380
would help the mercury

05:30.620 --> 05:32.380
spread all over their bodies.

05:32.450 --> 05:33.240
At this step,

05:33.680 --> 05:37.460
I could listen to their screams

05:37.600 --> 05:39.990
while watching their skin and muscles

05:40.010 --> 05:41.210
separate naturally.

05:41.690 --> 05:43.250
When the time was about right,

05:43.250 --> 05:44.510
I peeled off their skin

05:45.130 --> 05:46.590
little by little,

05:46.770 --> 05:48.830
starting from the top of their heads.

05:50.130 --> 05:51.390
There was a requirement

05:51.390 --> 05:53.250
in this.

05:54.010 --> 05:55.670
After the skin was peeled off,

05:55.810 --> 05:56.350
the person

05:56.350 --> 05:57.480
must still be alive.

05:58.720 --> 06:00.680
So here comes the question.

06:01.180 --> 06:02.220
Adjutant Zhang,

06:04.390 --> 06:05.950
I wonder if you also have

06:06.220 --> 06:08.890
any beautiful tattoos on your body.

06:09.810 --> 06:10.570
Kill him.

06:18.550 --> 06:19.300
Kill him.

06:27.330 --> 06:29.220
I wonder if you felt guilty

06:30.930 --> 06:32.530
when you peeled off the skin.

06:32.600 --> 06:36.060
Did you feel that killing a person was
the same as killing a pig?

06:38.320 --> 06:40.720
Some people have physiological reactions

06:41.180 --> 06:43.070
when they kill humans.

06:45.770 --> 06:47.060
Do you have any?

07:14.330 --> 07:15.180
Come out.

07:19.400 --> 07:22.530
I've been immune
to poisons and drugs since I was little.

07:22.660 --> 07:23.620
Your drugs

07:25.670 --> 07:26.620
can't work on me.

07:42.240 --> 07:42.700
What...

09:13.330 --> 09:19.470
[Archives: The Nanyang Mystery]

09:19.910 --> 09:22.600
[Episode 24]

09:44.640 --> 09:46.030
Sister! Sister!

09:46.120 --> 09:47.400
Sister! Sister!

09:47.690 --> 09:48.280
Sister!

09:52.780 --> 09:53.560
Sister...

09:55.860 --> 09:56.460
Chief,

09:56.790 --> 09:58.590
something went wrong at the inn.

11:26.500 --> 11:27.650
Choose how you want to die,

11:27.650 --> 11:29.180
and I will make that happen.

12:06.290 --> 12:06.960
Hurry!

12:07.200 --> 12:09.400
Everyone, pull back into the fortress!

12:49.130 --> 12:50.930
The Phoenix Fortress is on fire?

13:02.000 --> 13:03.930
Everyone, find a way
to shake off the soldiers immediately

13:03.930 --> 13:05.990
and retreat into the secret passage.

13:23.570 --> 13:24.230
Commander,

13:24.360 --> 13:25.820
we can't find the bandits.

13:27.250 --> 13:28.250
There's a secret passage here.

13:28.250 --> 13:30.710
I've figured out its approximate location.

13:31.250 --> 13:32.650
I'll draw the map for you.

13:54.220 --> 13:54.790
Come out!

13:55.240 --> 13:55.880
You guys!

13:55.900 --> 13:56.430
Get down.

13:56.890 --> 13:57.420
Get down!

13:57.430 --> 13:58.090
Don't move!

13:59.100 --> 13:59.630
Hurry up!

14:03.100 --> 14:05.180
Everyone in the secret passage, come out!

14:05.180 --> 14:05.840
Otherwise,

14:06.250 --> 14:07.980
I won't leave any of them alive!

14:12.280 --> 14:13.040
Let them go!

14:29.180 --> 14:30.160
Little girl,

14:31.050 --> 14:32.820
are you the Chief?

14:33.420 --> 14:34.440
I am the Chief!

15:20.160 --> 15:21.050
Look at her.

15:23.170 --> 15:25.030
You all should learn from her.

15:25.030 --> 15:26.390
She's a mere chief of a fortress

15:26.390 --> 15:27.520
and a little girl,

15:27.580 --> 15:28.980
yet she's so insightful.

15:30.720 --> 15:33.520
She knew that if she shot me dead,

15:33.650 --> 15:36.530
everyone in her fortress would get killed.

15:37.530 --> 15:39.590
Then you must understand this logic.

15:39.980 --> 15:42.370
Killing is very simple.

15:42.650 --> 15:45.340
But there are many issues that

15:45.340 --> 15:47.070
matter much more than killing.

15:47.390 --> 15:49.240
I don't want it to end up like this.

15:49.240 --> 15:51.390
Your men killed my men first.

15:52.270 --> 15:55.130
This is not like Nanqiang's way
of treating guests.

15:55.910 --> 15:57.310
I will ask you a question.

15:57.890 --> 15:58.820
If you answer me,

15:59.100 --> 16:01.960
you can save the lives
of everyone in your fortress.

16:09.030 --> 16:11.560
So you'd better answer me carefully.

16:12.080 --> 16:13.880
Don't listen to his crap, Chief!

16:17.290 --> 16:17.910
Son...

16:18.150 --> 16:18.940
Bro!

16:19.100 --> 16:20.100
What should we do?

16:22.360 --> 16:23.120
Son...

16:23.420 --> 16:24.420
My son...

16:41.660 --> 16:42.920
What is your question?

16:43.010 --> 16:43.490
Good.

16:45.240 --> 16:47.290
Here's my question. There is a man

16:47.320 --> 16:48.350
in a mask

16:49.270 --> 16:50.930
who is super good at fighting,

16:51.200 --> 16:52.150
like seriously

16:52.420 --> 16:54.660
not even human-level good.

16:55.470 --> 16:57.070
Do you know his whereabouts?

17:08.430 --> 17:10.230
I haven't seen anyone like this.

17:27.349 --> 17:30.550
My intuition is very accurate.

17:31.960 --> 17:32.550
She

17:37.480 --> 17:38.730
didn't lie.

17:40.290 --> 17:41.420
So it's fine now.

17:42.960 --> 17:43.890
It's fine.

17:44.890 --> 17:45.690
You may leave.

17:46.480 --> 17:49.280
I mean, take the people
of your fortress and leave.

17:51.750 --> 17:52.680
I just need

17:52.700 --> 17:54.430
to borrow this fortress, okay?

17:55.840 --> 17:56.510
Go!

19:19.940 --> 19:21.270
I'll kill you!

19:26.350 --> 19:27.160
Commander.

19:28.990 --> 19:30.450
You didn't keep your word.

19:30.940 --> 19:32.690
What's the difference
between you and those bandits?

19:32.690 --> 19:34.020
There's no difference.

19:34.220 --> 19:35.110
Well, there is one thing.

19:35.110 --> 19:37.160
It's that I am smarter than them.

19:37.290 --> 19:38.950
You see, if I were her just now,

19:39.340 --> 19:40.800
I would have definitely grabbed the gun

19:40.800 --> 19:41.990
and shot me.

19:42.140 --> 19:43.670
With the leaderless enemy,

19:43.720 --> 19:45.370
at least there would be a glimmer of hope.

19:45.370 --> 19:47.480
Look, now they've fallen into my hands,
and they're done for.

19:47.480 --> 19:48.610
Look at our soldiers

19:48.720 --> 19:50.410
and their men.

19:50.610 --> 19:53.240
There's absolutely no difference.

19:53.730 --> 19:55.790
Aren't they just a bunch of lunatics?

19:56.680 --> 19:59.210
Dangle a bit of temptation
in front of anyone,

19:59.220 --> 20:01.350
and they will risk their lives for you.

20:01.550 --> 20:02.330
That's why

20:02.990 --> 20:04.470
we must

20:04.690 --> 20:08.780
maintain their brutal animal nature
like this

20:09.050 --> 20:11.890
and offer temptation at the right time

20:12.070 --> 20:13.030
to satisfy them.

20:13.750 --> 20:15.410
I am good at this sort of thing,

20:15.580 --> 20:16.150
so

20:16.290 --> 20:17.510
I can become a dominant figure

20:17.510 --> 20:19.050
in these troubled times.

20:19.340 --> 20:20.300
I think today is

20:20.680 --> 20:22.010
the perfect time

20:22.150 --> 20:23.650
to let their animal nature

20:23.680 --> 20:25.810
run free.

20:26.570 --> 20:28.590
This is my reason for killing.

20:28.680 --> 20:30.480
What's your reason for killing?

20:55.020 --> 20:56.250
So brutal.

21:20.390 --> 21:21.330
Mo Yungao.

21:22.790 --> 21:24.590
Why did he also come to Nanqiang?

22:18.510 --> 22:19.910
Take the secret passage.

23:11.980 --> 23:12.980
Behave yourself!

23:13.230 --> 23:14.020
Don't move!

23:58.400 --> 23:59.920
They are the ones at fault,

24:00.590 --> 24:01.440
not you.

24:02.390 --> 24:04.150
You must live.

24:16.000 --> 24:16.900
You bastard!

24:25.700 --> 24:26.660
Brother...

24:27.000 --> 24:27.680
Brother!

25:33.870 --> 25:34.660
Brother!

26:28.250 --> 26:28.950
Hurry up.

26:28.970 --> 26:30.100
It's in the room ahead.

26:30.100 --> 26:31.100
Keep up, quickly!

26:52.810 --> 26:53.440
-Go!
-Go!

26:53.440 --> 26:54.070
Hurry up!

27:08.310 --> 27:08.920
Quickly!

27:31.160 --> 27:31.890
Shrimpie...

28:22.750 --> 28:25.680
Fate brings people together
no matter the distance.

28:30.680 --> 28:31.880
It should be this way.

28:40.680 --> 28:41.680
I want to go back.

28:42.460 --> 28:44.110
Going back now is a suicide act.

28:44.110 --> 28:45.240
Where there's life,

28:45.300 --> 28:46.360
there's hope.

28:46.480 --> 28:48.080
If we don't have a chance now,

28:48.110 --> 28:49.770
will we have one in the future?

28:49.870 --> 28:50.910
Xiao'er is dead.

28:51.500 --> 28:52.920
Great Golden Blade is dead.

28:52.920 --> 28:54.090
Everyone is dead.

28:55.770 --> 28:57.770
You run first. We'll cover the rear.

28:57.960 --> 28:58.590
Run now.

28:59.030 --> 29:00.010
You guys go.

29:03.910 --> 29:05.020
Take care, sister.

29:05.160 --> 29:06.360
See you in Bailejing.

29:06.360 --> 29:07.020
Go quickly.

29:11.240 --> 29:11.920
This way.

29:42.310 --> 29:43.110
Let's go.

29:49.380 --> 29:51.040
It's the sign of the Archives.

30:02.330 --> 30:04.130
"When you think there's no way out,

30:04.130 --> 30:05.930
a mighty army will come to help."

30:06.880 --> 30:07.850
This is what you mentioned,

30:07.850 --> 30:09.510
the Zhang family in Nanqiang?

30:09.810 --> 30:12.140
It seems
that there are quite a lot of them.

30:14.760 --> 30:15.700
Let's get out of here first.

30:15.700 --> 30:16.220
Okay.

30:29.090 --> 30:30.350
There's nowhere to go.

30:32.640 --> 30:33.310
Smoke.

30:33.770 --> 30:35.830
You're craving a smoke at the moment?

30:37.510 --> 30:38.310
Wait a minute!

30:39.570 --> 30:41.030
You didn't even say a word,

30:41.500 --> 30:42.960
yet you chased us this far.

30:43.090 --> 30:44.820
You all have good stamina, huh?

30:45.230 --> 30:46.350
There's no way out anyway.

30:46.350 --> 30:47.290
There's no need to rush it.

30:47.290 --> 30:48.290
Take your breath.

30:48.570 --> 30:49.530
I will perform

30:49.730 --> 30:50.790
a show for you guys!

30:54.560 --> 30:56.720
You people from the Zhang family
are quite interesting.

30:56.720 --> 30:58.090
But sometimes you are way too confident

30:58.090 --> 30:59.350
in your capabilities.

30:59.760 --> 31:01.230
In this situation,

31:01.500 --> 31:02.960
you are still struggling?

31:03.580 --> 31:04.790
As the old saying goes,

31:04.790 --> 31:06.140
nothing ventured,

31:06.380 --> 31:07.790
nothing gained!

31:19.480 --> 31:21.220
A flare shot into the sky

31:21.330 --> 31:23.720
summons a mighty army to come.

31:24.180 --> 31:25.750
Who summoned me?

31:26.500 --> 31:29.240
The Zhang family's Southern Archives!

31:34.960 --> 31:36.960
Then who are you guys?

31:38.350 --> 31:39.660
Why is it just you?

31:40.090 --> 31:41.560
Where is the "mighty army"
of the Zhang family?

31:41.560 --> 31:42.460
It's me.

31:42.700 --> 31:43.420
I am

31:43.490 --> 31:45.820
Zhang Qianjunwanma (means mighty army).

31:53.770 --> 31:56.310
Is the Zhang family
so unreliable in Bailejing?

31:56.310 --> 31:57.760
You'll get us all killed!

31:58.090 --> 32:00.890
I'm the one
who's going to be killed because of you.

32:01.210 --> 32:02.750
If I had known
it'd summon such a useless guy to come,

32:02.750 --> 32:04.210
we wouldn't have bothered

32:04.460 --> 32:05.590
wasting so much time there.

32:05.590 --> 32:06.790
Are you done talking?

32:07.030 --> 32:08.090
Will you ever stop?

32:09.450 --> 32:10.870
It's your first time in Bailejing.

32:10.870 --> 32:12.480
As a local member of the Zhang family,

32:12.480 --> 32:14.210
I must fulfill my duty as a host.

32:15.710 --> 32:16.940
Take it easy, please.

32:18.540 --> 32:19.370
Take this!

32:25.900 --> 32:26.700
Go after them!

32:34.100 --> 32:35.020
Go that way!

33:10.960 --> 33:12.260
You're not good at fighting,

33:12.260 --> 33:13.880
but you sure can run.

33:16.060 --> 33:16.860
Come with me.

33:17.310 --> 33:18.910
They won't catch us for sure.

33:39.900 --> 33:40.960
What is this place?

33:43.450 --> 33:45.340
This is where my mentor and I live.

33:45.880 --> 33:48.530
It's also where the Zhang family is
stationed in Nanqiang.

33:48.530 --> 33:49.340
Your mentor?

34:12.030 --> 34:12.889
Little Taoist,

34:13.320 --> 34:15.170
what was that amazing sorcery

34:15.510 --> 34:17.860
you just used?

34:19.199 --> 34:20.449
It's divine magic.

34:20.790 --> 34:22.730
I've been in this temple
with my mentor since I was a child,

34:22.730 --> 34:24.610
practicing the Five Ghosts Delivery.

34:24.610 --> 34:26.739
I've already mastered it thoroughly.

34:26.820 --> 34:27.780
Divine magic?

34:28.940 --> 34:30.500
Does our Zhang family
have this secret technique?

34:30.500 --> 34:31.900
It's just a trick.

34:32.170 --> 34:34.300
This Little Taoist conjured a fire dragon

34:34.300 --> 34:36.300
just in order to distract the enemy.

34:36.530 --> 34:38.000
But he was so fast

34:38.130 --> 34:39.730
that even you didn't notice.

34:39.820 --> 34:40.940
What do you know?

34:41.210 --> 34:42.610
The Five Ghosts Delivery

34:42.610 --> 34:44.540
can move everything in this world.

34:44.730 --> 34:45.790
As long as I want to,

34:46.210 --> 34:47.449
I can even move

34:47.820 --> 34:49.610
this temple away overnight.

34:51.780 --> 34:54.239
Zhang Qianzhang
taught you all this, right?

34:59.530 --> 35:00.730
You know my mentor?

35:03.260 --> 35:04.390
Who on earth are you?

35:05.070 --> 35:05.880
This is

35:05.940 --> 35:08.480
the former Director
of our Southern Archives,

35:08.480 --> 35:09.360
Zhang Haiqi.

35:20.940 --> 35:21.900
My mentor's wife...
